  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic charm with the Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring a cozy and timeless look to your bedroom. This set features classic patterns and soft fabrics, perfect for adding warmth and tradition to any home. Customize your quilt with optional pillowcases or a personalized name to create a truly unique bedding experience.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Features classic farmhouse patterns and soft, natural fabrics to create a cozy and timeless bedroom aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by adding a name or selecting optional pillowcases to enhance your bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat, ensuring simple and convenient maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from microfiber, which dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>5 sizes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
